WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:01.778
The Solomon Yau conjecture.

2
00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:05.136
The equator is the smallest minimal hypersurface

3
00:00:05.136 --> 00:00:07.471
of a round sphere. What comes second?

4
00:00:08.800 --> 00:00:13.299
Sweep with families, then climb dimension by dimension, ruling out bad limits.

5
00:00:14.300 --> 00:00:16.482
Claimed: a Clifford product of two spheres.

6
00:00:17.800 --> 00:00:18.544
Not in Lean.
